{"4568640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "House of Anomalies", "steam_appid": 4568640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👁️ Enter a House Twisted by Anomalies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a haunted house alone or in online co-op with up to <strong>7 friends</strong> as reality twists around you. Study each room carefully, search for disturbing anomalies, and decide what has changed before the house becomes even more unsettling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hallway, room, and object may hide something unnatural. Some changes are obvious. Others are subtle. The more you discover, the stranger the house becomes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🕯️ Spot the Anomalies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay close attention to your surroundings and compare each room to how it should look. <br>If something feels wrong, it probably is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From small changes to disturbing apparitions, every anomaly tests your memory, observation, and nerves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏚️ Inside the House</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568640/extras/45ab814562455eee59cdbb0080fefff5.avif?t=1785394040\" width=800 height=570 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🤝 Play Solo or Online Co-op</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the house alone or investigate together in <strong>online co-op</strong>. <br>Work with your friends to examine rooms, call out strange details, and figure out what is real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing together makes every discovery more intense as your team tries to separate imagination from reality.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >☠️ A Disturbing Haunted House</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a dark and eerie house filled with unsettling sights and supernatural events. <br>Encounter disturbing anomalies, blood-stained scenes, skeletons, grave markers, and other frightening details hidden throughout the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The house keeps changing, and it never feels safe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏆 Unlock Achievements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your progress and earn <strong>achievements</strong> as you explore the house, discover anomalies, and push deeper into its mysteries.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔍 Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👁️ <strong>Anomaly spotting gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤝 <strong>Online co-op multiplayer</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕯️ <strong>Creepy haunted house setting</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >☠️ <strong>Disturbing and supernatural events</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 <strong>Steam achievements</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎧 <strong>Immersive horror atmosphere</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔄 <strong>Replayable anomaly encounters</strong></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👁️ Enter a House Twisted by Anomalies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a haunted house alone or in online co-op with up to <strong>7 friends</strong> as reality twists around you. Study each room carefully, search for disturbing anomalies, and decide what has changed before the house becomes even more unsettling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hallway, room, and object may hide something unnatural. Some changes are obvious. Others are subtle. The more you discover, the stranger the house becomes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🕯️ Spot the Anomalies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay close attention to your surroundings and compare each room to how it should look. <br>If something feels wrong, it probably is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From small changes to disturbing apparitions, every anomaly tests your memory, observation, and nerves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏚️ Inside the House</h2><p class=\"b